<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:58:08 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>代码出现 600 年前，印加人只用“结”建造了世界上第一台计算机</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/600-years-before-code-existed-the-inca-built-the-worlds-first-computer-using-nothing-but-knots</link><description>结、绳子和颜色，这就是全部。一项新的研究表明，印加人建造了一种与计算机极其相似的东西，比第一台计算机早几个世纪。这是研究人员在实际尝试运行它时发现的结果。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/600-years-before-code-existed-the-inca-built-the-worlds-first-computer-using-nothing-but-knots.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:58:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/600-years-before-code-existed-the-inca-built-the-worlds-first-computer-using-nothing-but-knots</guid></item><item><title>现代吟游诗人马丁·肖博士：成为时代的故事制造者</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/modern-bard-dr-martin-shaw-be-a-story-maker-for-your-times</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/modern-bard-dr-martin-shaw-be-a-story-maker-for-your-times.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:43:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/modern-bard-dr-martin-shaw-be-a-story-maker-for-your-times</guid></item><item><title>探测地球如何扭曲时空</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/detecting-how-earth-twists-spacetime</link><description>拟议的基于实验室的量子传感器可以在几秒钟内精确测量由地球自转引起的时空扭曲。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/detecting-how-earth-twists-spacetime.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:28:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/detecting-how-earth-twists-spacetime</guid></item><item><title>用超导磁体准直正电子</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/collimating-positrons-with-superconducting-magnets</link><description>最近的一项实验为制造下一代正负电子对撞机所需的强烈、高能正电子束指明了道路。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/collimating-positrons-with-superconducting-magnets.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 14:13:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/collimating-positrons-with-superconducting-magnets</guid></item><item><title>纳米管材料具有完美的记忆能力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nanotube-material-has-perfect-memory</link><description>无论压缩速度如何，碳纳米管泡沫都会弹回其初始状态，这一特性可能会导致新型减震器的诞生。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nanotube-material-has-perfect-memory.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:58:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nanotube-material-has-perfect-memory</guid></item><item><title>物理学家在大型强子对撞机上扩展了对量子黑洞的搜索</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/physicists-extend-the-search-for-quantum-black-holes-at-the-lhc</link><description>加州大学圣巴巴拉分校的物理学家扩大了对欧洲核研究组织 (CERN) 大型强子对撞机 (LHC) 产生的微观黑洞证据的搜索范围。这些微小的、转瞬即逝的物体在大型强子对撞机上的形成代表了理论学家在我们理解时空基本结构中寻求解决异常现象的一种方式，而用于寻找它们的方法则展示了一种寻找新粒子的新方法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/physicists-extend-the-search-for-quantum-black-holes-at-the-lhc.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:43:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/physicists-extend-the-search-for-quantum-black-holes-at-the-lhc</guid></item><item><title>堆叠二维材料揭示了室温多铁性和压控磁性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stacked-2d-materials-reveal-room-temperature-multiferroicity-and-voltage-controlled-magnetism</link><description>多铁性材料是同时表现出两个或多个铁序的材料，即物理性质的稳定排列，可以使用外部刺激进行切换。这些材料对于各种技术的开发非常有利，包括非易失性、低功耗存储器件、自旋电子器件、微型电子器件、神经形态硬件、传感器和磁电器件。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/stacked-2d-materials-reveal-room-temperature-multiferroicity-and-voltage-controlled-magnetism2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:28:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stacked-2d-materials-reveal-room-temperature-multiferroicity-and-voltage-controlled-magnetism</guid></item><item><title>新研究表明人类大脑有一个分裂的起源</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-brain-has-a-split-origin-new-research-suggests</link><description>几个世纪以来，科学家一直认为大脑是一个单一的、统一的器官。但斯坦福大学医学院领导的新研究表明，我们所说的大脑是两个不同的器官，它们独立进化了数亿年。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/human-brain-has-a-split-origin-new-research-suggests.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:13:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-brain-has-a-split-origin-new-research-suggests</guid></item><item><title>三篇学生论文表明，氨基酸和骨矿物质可能有助于控制镁植入物的分解</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/amino-acids-and-a-bone-mineral-may-help-control-magnesium-implant-breakdown-three-student-papers-suggest</link><description>在科学期刊上发表学士论文相对罕见。对于同一个研究小组的三篇论文来说，在短短三个月内发表科学出版物是极其罕见的。然而，这正是量子器件物理部 Elsebeth Schröder 的研究小组所发生的事情。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/amino-acids-and-a-bone-mineral-may-help-control-magnesium-implant-breakdown-three-student-papers-suggest2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 12:58:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/amino-acids-and-a-bone-mineral-may-help-control-magnesium-implant-breakdown-three-student-papers-suggest</guid></item><item><title>激光实验重现太阳耀斑物理学并揭示一致的磁重联率</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/laser-experiments-recreate-solar-flare-physics-and-reveal-consistent-magnetic-reconnection-rates</link><description>磁重联是当导电等离子体的磁场快速重新排列并释放大量存储的磁能时发生的过程。人们普遍认为这是太阳耀斑和地球磁层亚暴等宇宙事件背后的潜在机制。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/laser-experiments-recreate-solar-flare-physics-and-reveal-consistent-magnetic-reconnection-rates2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 12:43:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/laser-experiments-recreate-solar-flare-physics-and-reveal-consistent-magnetic-reconnection-rates</guid></item></channel></rss>